    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\nSpecial marketing build.\n> T to change timescale\n> D to toggle debug text\n> F to toggle FPS recording\n> L to shorten the distance to the next destination\n> G (long press) to unlock all guitars\n> R (long press) to reset the game\n> input a number to access the card with that id\n\n>> Go at least once to the first planet to initialise the game.<<"
